T22R0301_00008"]],["End",[]]]},"messages":{"msg_0560_T22R0301_00000":"Earl, I am!\\nWonderful are Pokémon, yes!\\rTeach you I will to be a better Trainer!\\rWhat you want to know?\\nWant to be a winner is you? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00001":"Good! Teach you, I will!\\nIn battle, Pokémon top on list,\\fthe walking one, jump out first!\\rChange order in list, make battle\\neasy, maybe!\\rMore from me you want to hear? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00002":"So, want to know how to raise\\nPokémon well? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00003":"Fine! Teach you, I will!\\nIf Pokémon come out in battle even\\fbriefly, some Exp. Points it gets.\\rKeep out weak Pokémon,\\nswitch in battle quick!\\rThis way, weak Pokémon very\\nstrong become!\\fMore from me you want to hear? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00004":"So, want to know how to\\nbattle well? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00005":"Fine! Teach you, I will!\\nPokémon have goods and bads\\fbecause many types.\\rHigh-level Pokémon not win always\\nif bad types.\\rPokémon with good types\\nfor the foe, you choose.\\fSmart battle, it is!","msg_0560_T22R0301_00006":"Oh! Smart student you are!\\nNothing more do I teach!\\rGood to Pokémon you must be!","msg_0560_T22R0301_00007":"I’m taking notes of the teacher’s\\nlecture.\\rI’d better copy the stuff on the\\nblackboard, too.","msg_0560_T22R0301_00008":"I traded my best Pokémon to the\\nguy beside me.","msg_0560_T22R0301_00009":"Huh? The Pokémon I just got is\\nholding something!","msg_0560_T22R0301_00010":"...Some Berries can restore a\\nPokémon’s health.\\rMany other items can be held\\nby Pokémon...\\rIt sure is tough taking notes...","msg_0560_T22R0301_00011":"Pokémon have what are called\\nabilities!\\rIt seems that each kind of Pokémon has\\ndistinct abilities.\\rThey say these abilities come in handy\\nin battle!","msg_0560_T22R0301_00012":"The blackboard explains Pokémon\\nstatus changes in battle.\\r","msg_0560_T22R0301_00013":"Read which topic? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00014":"If poisoned, a Pokémon steadily\\nloses HP.\\rThe poison lingers after the battle,\\nand HP is lost as you walk.\\fTo cure it, use an Antidote.\\r","msg_0560_T22R0301_00015":"Paralysis reduces speed and may\\nprevent movement.\\rIt remains after battle, so use\\na Parlyz Heal.\\r","msg_0560_T22R0301_00016":"If asleep, your Pokémon can use only\\ncertain moves, such as Sleep Talk and\\fSnore.\\rA sleeping Pokémon doesn’t wake up\\nafter battle.\\fWake it up with an Awakening.\\r","msg_0560_T22R0301_00017":"A burn consumes HP, little by little,\\nand also reduces the Attack stat.\\rA burn lingers after battle.\\nUse a Burn Heal as the cure.\\r","msg_0560_T22R0301_00018":"If your Pokémon is frozen,\\nit can’t do a thing.\\rIt remains frozen after battle.\\nThaw it out with an Ice Heal.\\r","msg_0560_T22R0301_00019":"It’s this kid’s notebook...\\r“Catch Pokémon using Poké Balls.\\nUp to six can be in your party.”\\rKeep reading? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00020":"“Before throwing a Poké Ball, weaken\\nthe target first.”\\r“A poisoned or burned Pokémon is\\neasier to catch.”\\rKeep reading? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00021":"“Some moves may cause confusion.\\nConfusion may make a Pokémon attack\\fitself.”\\r“Leaving battle clears up any\\nconfusion.”\\rKeep reading? {YESNO 0}","msg_0560_T22R0301_00022":"“People who catch and use Pokémon\\nin battle are called Pokémon Trainers.”\\r“They are expected to visit Pokémon\\nGyms and defeat other Trainers.”\\rThe next page is... Blank!\\r","msg_0560_T22R0301_00023":"Boy: E-he-he...\\nI haven’t written any more...","msg_0560_T22R0301_00024":"POISON","msg_0560_T22R0301_00025":"PARALYSIS","msg_0560_T22R0301_00026":"SLEEP","msg_0560_T22R0301_00027":"BURN","msg_0560_T22R0301_00028":"FROZEN","msg_0560_T22R0301_00029":"EXIT","msg_0560_T22R0301_00030":"","msg_0560_T22R0301_00031":"","msg_0560_T22R0301_00032":"","msg_0560_T22R0301_00033":"","msg_0560_T22R0301_00034":"","msg_0560_T22R0301_00035":""},"initTriggers":[